  "fullDescription": "This Digital Planners – Landscape Mode is an ultimate tool to maximize your productivity and get the balance between your professional, personal, and family time. With a creative design, fully hyperlinked for effortless navigation, it contains several pages of lifestyle planning. This Digital Planner is the #1 tool to organize your life and achieve your goals, We guarantee it will help you make positive changes. Just download, and make this year a superb one. It is a game-changing tool for planning out your day and life.\n✔︎ Fully hyperlinked to make navigation buttery smooth\n✔︎ Lifestyle, Wellness, Health & Fitness, Productivity, & Finance, sections\n✔︎ Daily, weekly, monthly Planning Pages\n✔︎ Monday and Sunday start\n✔︎ 5 Custom notes pages with hyperlinked tabs\n✔︎ Index page hyperlinked to all lifestyle planning pages\n✔︎ 600 Pages\n✔︎ Landscape Mode\n✔︎ Minimal, modern, chic & stylish design.\n✔︎ All pages can be easily duplicated and/or removed\n\nRemember you are worthy. Invest in you!\n\n𝗪𝗛𝗔𝗧’𝗦 𝗜𝗡𝗖𝗟𝗨𝗗𝗘𝗗?\n– Full-Year Digital Planner\n– Monthly Planner(12 Months)\n– Weekly Planner(52 Weeks)\n– Daily Planner(365 Days)\n– Sunday or Monday Start\n\nYEAR AT A GLANCE\n– Calendar\n– Important Dates\n– Yearly Reflection\n– Quarter 1\n– Quarter 2\n– Quarter 3\n– Quarter 4\n\nLIFESTYLE\n– Designing positive habits\n– Packing List\n– Grocery List\n– Trip Planner\n– Trip Itinerary\n– Meal Ideas\n– Meal Planner\n– Outfit Planner\n– Cleaning Log\n– Movie Log\n– Reading Journal\n\nWELLNESS\n– Wheel of life\n– Sleep Tracker\n– Mood Tracker\n– Dream Tracker\n– Dream Analysis\n– Gratitude Jar\n– YouTube\n– Podcasts\n– Recipes\n\nPRODUCTIVITY\n– Project planner\n– Goal planner\n– 30 Days Challenge\n– Mind map\n– My Bucket list\n– Travel planner\n– My Wishlist\n– Password log\n\nHEALTH & FITNESS\n– Period Tracker\n– Self-Care Goals\n– Water Tracker\n– Step Tracker\n– Progress Tracker\n– Doctor Visits\n– Symptom Tracker\n– Pain Tracker\n– Medication Tracker\n– Workout Log\n– Vitamin & Supplement\n\nFINANCE\n– Yearly finance\n– Monthly budget planner\n– Spending Tracker\n– Subscription tracker\n– Bill payment tracker\n– Debt payment tracker\n– 30-day savings challenge\n– 52-week savings challenge\n\nDASHBOARD\n– MONTHLY GOALS ( Jan to Dec: 12 Months)\n– MONTHLY VISION BOARD ( Jan to Dec: 12 Months)\n– MONTHLY HEALTHY HABITS( Jan to Dec: 12 Months)\n– MONTHLY REFLECTION ( Jan to Dec: 12 Months)\n\nNOTES\n– Blank\n– Lined\n– Checklist\n– Dotted\n– Half grid\n– Grid\n\nCOMPATIBLE\nWorks with iPad and Android Tablets.\nSupported Annotation Apps: GoodNotes, Notability, and Xodo\nNote: All compatible apps or software may be chargeable.\n\nHOW TO DOWNLOAD IT?\nFiles are not emailed to you. For your convenience, they are available for download directly on Creativefabrica, On the My Profile, go to You > My Downloads > Click the button “Download Files”.\n\nDownloading and Unzipping from Creative Fabrica\nClick the green download button next to the file you want.\nThe file will download as a .zip file.\nRight-click the .zip file on your computer.\nSelect “Extract All” (Windows) or “Open With > Archive Utility” (Mac).\nChoose a folder and click “Extract” or “Unzip”.\n\nHOW TO USE IT?\n—Download your digital files on your device.\nImport to GoodNotes or any Annotation app\n\nIf you have any further questions, please do not hesitate to contact me via Etsy.\n\nThank you for choosing us!",
